    "sections": {
        "description": "Tax Consultant is a modern, responsive, and fully customizable theme designed for professionals in taxes, accounting, finance, and consulting, making it ideal for accounting firms, tax advisors, financial consultants, CPA firms, and business consultants. It features a clean and professional layout that allows you to effectively showcase tax consultant services, financial expertise, and client success stories, helping build trust and credibility. The theme includes pre-built sections for testimonials, team profiles, case studies, and service packages, making it easy to present offerings such as personal tax planning, corporate tax management, bookkeeping, payroll solutions, and tax advisory. Built with performance-optimized and SEO-friendly code, it ensures fast loading speeds, smooth functionality, and better visibility on search engines across all devices. With drag-and-drop page building, multiple demo layouts, and customizable headers and footers, users can easily personalize their website without technical complexity. It also integrates seamlessly with essential plugins such as WooCommerce for offering online consultations or selling financial resources, Contact Form 7 for inquiries, and Mailchimp for email marketing. Additional features like retina-ready design, social media integration, and responsive structure enhance user experience and engagement, making Tax Consultant a powerful and reliable solution for professionals looking to establish and grow their online presence."
    },
